{
  "title": "Azure Embedding Service Dashboard",
  "description": "Comprehensive monitoring of Azure OpenAI embedding service operations, performance metrics, and API usage",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "API Usage Overview",
        "show_title": true,
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "API Calls - Last 24 Hours",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.request_count{$env,$deployment}.as_count().rollup(sum, 60)",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "API Calls"
              },
              "markers": []
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Token Usage - Last 24 Hours",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.token_count{$env,$deployment}.rollup(sum, 60)",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Tokens"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "API Errors",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.errors{$env,$deployment}.as_count().rollup(sum, 60)",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Error Count",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Rate Limiting and Throttling",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Rate Limit Utilization",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.rate_limit_utilization{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Utilization %",
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 80",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 90",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Throttling Events",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.throttling.events{$env,$deployment}.as_count()",
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Throttling Events"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Performance Metrics",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "API Latency",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.api_latency{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Latency (ms)"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Embedding Generation Time",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.generation_time{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Generation Time (ms)"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Vector Database Operations",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.db_operation_time{$env,$deployment} by {operation_type}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Operation Time (ms)"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Connection Pool Metrics",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Connection Pool Utilization",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_utilization{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Utilization %",
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 80",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 90",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Connection Pool - Active vs. Idle",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_active_connections{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "expression": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_active_connections{$env,$deployment}",
                    "alias_name": "Active Connections"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_idle_connections{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "expression": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.pool_idle_connections{$env,$deployment}",
                    "alias_name": "Idle Connections"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Connections"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Connection Acquisition Time",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.connection_acquire_time{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Acquisition Time (ms)"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Vector Search Performance",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Search Latency",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.search_latency{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Latency (ms)"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Search Result Count",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:azure.openai.embedding.search_result_count{$env,$deployment}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear",
                "label": "Average Results"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Business Metrics",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Estimated Cost (USD)",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1 / 1000 * 0.0001"
                    }
                  ],
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "query": "sum:azure.openai.embedding.token_count{$env,$deployment}.rollup(sum)",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "query1",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 10,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 5,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 5,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2,
              "unit": "$"
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Token Usage Distribution",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "top(sum:azure.openai.embedding.token_count{$env,$deployment} by {operation}, 10, 'sum', 'desc')",
                  "conditional_formats": []
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Azure Embedding Service Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard provides comprehensive monitoring of Azure OpenAI embedding service operations, performance metrics, and API usage.\n\n### Key Metrics to Monitor:\n\n- **API Usage**: Track the number of API calls, token usage, and error rates\n- **Rate Limiting**: Monitor API quota utilization and throttling events\n- **Performance**: Track latency for embedding generation and vector searches\n- **Connection Pool**: Monitor utilization and connection acquisition times\n- **Cost**: Track estimated costs based on token usage\n\n### Alert Recommendations:\n\n- Set alerts when rate limit utilization exceeds 80%\n- Set alerts when error rates spike above normal baseline\n- Set alerts when connection pool utilization exceeds 90%\n- Set alerts when search or embedding latency exceeds SLA thresholds",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": true,
        "tick_pos": "bottom",
        "tick_edge": "left"
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "default": "*",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "production",
        "staging",
        "development"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "deployment",
      "default": "*",
      "prefix": "deployment"
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "is_read_only": false,
  "notify_list": []
}